  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This should have been talked about a long time ago. This feature would allow us to set the avatars size in game without the need to upload the same avatar multiple times in different heights. This will also help with people loading in and out of avatars in different worlds. This feature also scale our viewpoint so we have the feeling of growing or shrinking. As avatar creators we would have a new feature that allows us to set the max and min height, if not there will be a default. For the older avatars this feature can be disabled because of particle sizing.",
